WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
You sit down to read. Two sentences later,
your attention is elsewhere.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
For centuries, people have tried to explain
what suggestion does to the mind.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Researchers have studied hypnosis.
That does not prove every recording works.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
A commercial recording is a product, with
a format, a price, and claims worth checking.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Try twelve minutes without buying anything.
Notice how you return to your task.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Then compare the actual offer.
Evidence first. You decide.
